# Which Convex deployment this build talks to. Copy to `.env` and fill in.
#
# Read `NEXT_PUBLIC_CONVEX_URL` from the repo root's `.env.local` to match what
# the web app is using, or run `npx convex dev` and take the URL it prints.
#
# Careful: `EXPO_PUBLIC_*` is inlined by Metro at bundle time. There is no
# runtime override, so this value is baked into the APK. A release build pointed
# at a dev deployment would be a public app reading and writing disposable dev
# data — see `docs/deployment.md` for which host is production.
EXPO_PUBLIC_CONVEX_URL=
